%%{init: {"theme":"dark"}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> MESSAGE_CREATE: Discord Event

    MESSAGE_CREATE --> SKIP_BOT: messageCreate
    SKIP_BOT --> EVAL_TRIGGER: author != bot
    SKIP_BOT --> [*]: author == bot (ignore)

    EVAL_TRIGGER --> HANDLE_COMMAND: evaluateMessage()
    HANDLE_COMMAND --> [*]: -stop/-start/-clear (responded ✓)
    HANDLE_COMMAND --> CHECK_SLEEP: not a command

    CHECK_SLEEP --> CHECK_SESSION: sleepBehavior != "sleep"
    CHECK_SLEEP --> IGNORE_SILENT: sleepBehavior == "sleep" (not mention/dm)

    CHECK_SESSION --> PAUSED_QUEUE: sessionPaused.has(cid)
    PAUSED_QUEUE --> [*]: queued for later
    CHECK_SESSION --> RESET_COUNTER: check sessionResetMinutes expiry
    RESET_COUNTER --> SHOULD_RESPOND: sessionCounts.delete if expired

    SHOULD_RESPOND --> CHECK_IGNORE: shouldRespond == true
    SHOULD_RESPOND --> CHECK_FOLLOWUP: shouldRespond == false

    CHECK_IGNORE --> CHECK_FORGET: !shouldIgnore()
    CHECK_IGNORE --> IGNORE_PROB: shouldIgnore() → [*]
    CHECK_FORGET --> COMPUTE_DELAY: roll < forgetChance → forgotten [*]

    COMPUTE_DELAY --> REACT_AND_WAIT: computeDelay() + setTimeout
    REACT_AND_WAIT --> TRIGGER_REPLY: delay elapsed
    REACT_AND_WAIT --> ADD_REACTION: shouldReact() → addReaction

    TRIGGER_REPLY --> ANTI_SPAM_CHECK: triggerLunaReply()
    ANTI_SPAM_CHECK --> QUEUE_PENDING: processing.has(key) → wait [*]
    ANTI_SPAM_CHECK --> MARK_PROCESSING: free to proceed

    MARK_PROCESSING --> PICK_REPLY_STYLE: pickReplyStyle()
    PICK_REPLY_STYLE --> STREAM_SETUP: setup onToken/onFlush

    STREAM_SETUP --> HESITATION_CHECK: register event listeners
    HESITATION_CHECK --> START_TYPING: once("token", startTyping)

    START_TYPING --> CALL_LLM: askLLM({username, text})
    CALL_LLM --> STREAM_TOKENS: LLM emits token events
    STREAM_TOKENS --> FLUSH_MESSAGE: on("flush") → createMessage (per newline)
    FLUSH_MESSAGE --> STREAM_TOKENS: continue until done
    STREAM_TOKENS --> RESIDUAL_FLUSH: done → flush remaining buffer

    RESIDUAL_FLUSH --> VOICE_CHECK: text response sent
    VOICE_CHECK --> TTS_SEND: shouldSendVoice() && !hasUnsafeTTSText()
    VOICE_CHECK --> TYPO_CHECK: no voice or unsafe text
    TTS_SEND --> TYPO_CHECK: sendTextAsVoiceMessage()
    TYPO_CHECK --> CORRECT_TYPO: typo chance roll → createMessage("word*")
    TYPO_CHECK --> TRACK_SPEAKER: no typo
    CORRECT_TYPO --> TRACK_SPEAKER

    TRACK_SPEAKER --> CLEANUP: trackSpeaker()
    CLEANUP --> DRAIN_PENDING: doneProcessing() + off listeners
    DRAIN_PENDING --> RECURSE_TRIGGER: pending exists → triggerLunaReply()
    DRAIN_PENDING --> [*]: no pending

    CHECK_FOLLOWUP --> CAN_FOLLOWUP: canFollowUp() check
    CAN_FOLLOWUP --> FOLLOWUP_DELAY: true → computeDelay()
    CAN_FOLLOWUP --> [*]: false → trackSpeaker() [*]
    FOLLOWUP_DELAY --> FOLLOWUP_REACT: wait
    FOLLOWUP_REACT --> FOLLOWUP_CALL: shouldReact() → addReaction
    FOLLOWUP_REACT --> FOLLOWUP_CALL: no reaction
    FOLLOWUP_CALL --> TRIGGER_REPLY: triggerLunaReply("follow-up")

    IGNORE_SILENT --> [*]
    IGNORE_PROB --> [*]

    note right of PAUSED_QUEUE: Messages queued until<br/>the end of the session pause
    note right of STREAM_TOKENS: Word-by-word emission with delay<br/>20-80ms between each word
    note right of FLUSH_MESSAGE: Each newline = a separate<br/>Discord message
    note right of RECURSE_TRIGGER: Allows processing the next<br/>message in the queue
